<title>FRANCE: Casino H1 turnover up 5.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Casino H1 turnover up 5.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					33,326    vs   31,630</p>
<p>	  - of which Distribution	     31,545    vs   29,802</p>
<p>			 Other			 1,781    vs    1,828</p>
<p>NOTE - The French retail group gave the sales figures, which exclude tax, in a newspaper advertisement.</p>
